    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Once again, you only have to draw one continuous line. <br><br>When you draw on a tile, it will change color from orange to blue or from blue to orange. You solve each puzzle, by making all tiles akin. <br><br>There are 96 puzzles on &quot;Normal&quot;-mode and 96 puzzles in &quot;Time&quot;-mode. Each puzzles can have many different solutions. Start with basic puzzles and unlock harder ones. <br><br>There are also special tiles. The &quot;Teleport&quot;-tile, teleports the line to another point in the puzzle. The &quot;Double Use&quot;-tile can be used twice, which is requires to solve some of the puzzles",
